and applicable law.
SECTION 3. Calling of Election.
Pursuant to Elections Code section 9222, Government Code sections 53723 and 53724,
Article XIII C of the California Constitution, and all other applicable law, the City Council hereby calls
and orders an election to be held in the City of Chino on Tuesday, November 3, 2026, for the purpose
of submitting to the qualified voters of the City the general tax measure described in this Resolution.
SECTION 4. Ballot Question.
That the City Council, pursuant to its right and authority, does order submitted to the voters
at the General Municipal Election the following question:
